Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For the Spin twenty audit, the degree eighteen Clifford element squares to minus one. Multiplication by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,minus i makes the representation matrix square to plus one. This distinction matters for an ordinary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,isotropy lift. It does not prove the model inconsistent: a twisted or combined action may be possible. Every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,field and interaction, including bosonic Omega, must share a specified action.
